===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|coraçon}}, from {{inh|pt|VL.|*corāceōnem}}, derived from {{der|pt|la|cor}}, from {{der|pt|itc-pro|*kord}}, from {{der|pt|ine-pro|*ḱḗr}} ~ {{m|ine-pro||*ḱr̥d-}}.

Compare {{cog|gl,es|corazón}}, {{cog|mxi|قرجون|tr=qurəjūn}}.

